子户，完全够用，环境懒得配置。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087317\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f954/2140/102303_normal.png?m=1731911648\" alt=\"Jasonwxy\" data-uid=\"102303\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>62</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jasonwxy\">Jasonwxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:22:36 +08:00\">13h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>M4 的 mac mini 和 M1 Pro 都升了</p><p>发现一个飞连 2.0 的兼容性问题<br>飞连 2.0 版本启动后报错<br>Error: Command failed: ./applet /bin/sh: ./applet: Bad CPU type in executable</p><p>问了 ChatGPT 解决了<br>命令行里执行<br>softwareupdate --install-rosetta<br>作用是 从 Apple 下载并安装 Rosetta 2 ，让 Apple 芯片的 Mac 能运行为 Intel 芯片编译的程序</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087472\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7e19/69c8/77850_normal.png?m=1789113801\" alt=\"Rorysky\" data-uid=\"77850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rorysky\">Rorysky</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:42:18 +08:00\">13h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>等 homebrew 不支持 15.5 我再升级</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087507\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/86d448822c29143a950fc6d9cf57a840?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"achong\" data-uid=\"609424\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>64</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/achong\">achong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:47:53 +08:00\">13h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>m4max 升完感觉良好，内存压力变小，没那么占内存了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087561\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ad11/5d27/123841_normal.png?m=1748350949\" alt=\"gowk\" data-uid=\"123841\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>65</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gowk\">gowk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:54:43 +08:00\">13h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>M4 mini 16G 表示不想折腾了，升了 15.8 养老了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087623\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/67369b8d92ce9b7dd06e1913ec9e7079?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"starlight98\" data-uid=\"628154\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>66</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/starlight98\">starlight98</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 15:02:33 +08:00\">13h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也蹲一蹲 我是 M2 的 MacBook Air 卡到 15.7 不敢往上升</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087694\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/460d/16b5/435700_normal.png?m=1703664228\" alt=\"brom111\